    {
      "Original": "Filter category of the \"Chat Message\" death notification.\n\"Debug\" will show up in all chat tabs regardless of configuration.\nNote that this will only affect the way the notification is displayed to you. They will never be visible to others.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.ChatMessageTypeTooltip",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "「聊天消息」死亡通知的消息类别。\n选择「调试」后，无论聊天设置如何，通知均会出现在所有聊天页。\n此选项只影响你看到通知的方式，其他玩家始终看不到这些通知。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Prints the command in the chat to reopen the window the first time you close the Death Recap.",
